115
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:27,900
So it could be an existing vulnerability like reflected excess where you take that and you

116
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:32,300
combine it with cache poisoning and it becomes much more serious.

117
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:37,580
Or it could be something that's actually completely harmless by itself but becomes quite serious

118
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:40,660
when chained with cache poisoning.

119
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:42,800
And that is the methodology.

